values ('8ccf1d85-b613-5bf2-a656-75f0276933cf', 'b79c1ee1-545d-5476-b950-15dad4a2637b', 1, 'Mix the semolina, yogurt, 100g of the sugar, butter and baking powder into a thick batter.', 'اخلط السميد والزبادي و١٠٠ جم من السكر والزبدة والبيكنج بودر لحد ما يبقى خليط تقيل.', 10, null, null, '{"semolina","yogurt","sugar","butter","baking powder","desiccated coconut"}');
